{%- comment -%}
  Nikhar (ADR-734): Hatti Base dressed for beauty and skincare. Square photos in soft rounded
  cards, as bottles and palettes are shot; a blush palette, rounded headings' weight kept light,
  and pill buttons.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% style %}
  h1,
  h2,
  h3 {
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .card {
    padding: 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 1rem;
    background: #fff;
    box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgb(63 29 43 / 0.08);
  }
  .card__media {
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    background: #fdf2f6;
  }
  .card__title {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
  }
  .button {
    border-radius: 999px;
  }
  html .banner {
    background: #831843;
  }
{% endstyle %}
